  "fullDescription": "Dive into a world of sunshine and sweetness with our Watercolor Kawaii Orange Clipart Bundle! This delightful collection features a vibrant array of hand-painted orange-themed illustrations, from luscious whole oranges and juicy slices to refreshing drinks, delectable cakes, charming cupcakes, and delightful popsicles. Each element is meticulously crafted with a soft watercolor touch and an adorable ‘kawaii’ aesthetic, bringing a fresh, playful, and cheerful vibe to your projects. Perfect for digital scrapbooking, creating unique invitations, designing captivating social media graphics, enhancing educational materials, or adding a citrusy splash to branding and packaging. All images are high-resolution 300 DPI PNGs with transparent backgrounds, ensuring easy integration into any design. Unleash your creativity and infuse your designs with the sweet, zesty charm of these kawaii oranges!",
